@startuml Proxy

interface Image {
    +display() : void
}

class HighResImage {
    -filename_ : string
    +display() : void
}

class ImageProxy {
    -filename_ : string
    -realImage_ : unique_ptr<HighResImage>
    +display() : void
}

Image <|.. HighResImage
Image <|.. ImageProxy
ImageProxy ..> HighResImage : creates lazily & delegates

note right of ImageProxy
  display() creates
  HighResImage only on first
  call, then forwards to it —
  clients can't tell they're
  holding a proxy.
end note

@enduml